### Applications CRUD Operations

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4001
@contentType = application/json
@testUserId = test-user-123

### 1. Create Internship Application - Valid
# @name createInternshipApp
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{testUserId}}",
    "application_type": "Internship",
    "status": "Brouillon",
    "type": "Internship",
    "data": {
        "company": "TechCorp Solutions",
        "position": "Software Developer Intern",
        "duration_months": 6,
        "start_date": "2025-09-01",
        "supervisor_name": "John Smith",
        "supervisor_email": "john.smith@techcorp.com",
        "description": "Full-stack development internship focusing on React and Node.js",
        "requirements": "Knowledge of JavaScript, React, Node.js. Basic understanding of databases."
    }
}

###

### 2. Create Incubation Application - Valid
# @name createIncubationApp
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{testUserId}}",
    "application_type": "Incubation",
    "status": "Brouillon",
    "type": "Incubation",
    "data": {
        "project_name": "EcoTech Startup",
